  "raw_text": "```\nPLAN \"Deload Week\"\nTYPE workout\nVISIBILITY public\n\nGOALS\n  GOAL primary recovery:\n    name \"Active recovery and CNS restoration\"\n\nPHASES\n  PHASE \"Deload Week\" (1 week):\n    WEEK 1:\n      DAY Monday training 50m \"Upper Body Deload\":\n        warmup:\n          running 5m\n          arm_circles 1m\n          scapular_retraction 3x8\n        main straight_sets:\n          bench_press 3x6 rpe 5 rest 60 seconds\n          barbell_row 3x6 rpe 5 rest 60 seconds\n          incline_press 2x6 rpe 5 rest 60 seconds\n          lat_pulldown 2x8 rpe 5 rest 60 seconds\n          face_pull 2x12 rpe 4 rest 45 seconds\n          bicep_curl 2x8 rpe 4 rest 45 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          chest_stretch 90 seconds\n          lat_stretch 90 seconds\n          shoulder_stretch 90 seconds\n\n      DAY Wednesday training 50m \"Lower Body Deload\":\n        warmup:\n          walking 5m\n          leg_swings 2m\n          hip_circles 1m\n          bodyweight_squat 2x8\n        main straight_sets:\n          squat 3x6 rpe 5 rest 60 seconds\n          deadlift 3x5 rpe 5 rest 75 seconds\n          leg_press 2x8 rpe 5 rest 60 seconds\n          leg_curl 2x8 rpe 4 rest 45 seconds\n          calf_raise 2x12 rpe 4 rest 45 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          quad_stretch 90 seconds\n          hamstring_stretch 90 seconds\n          hip_flexor_stretch 90 seconds\n\n      DAY Friday training 45m \"Full Body Deload\":\n        warmup:\n          cycling 5m\n          arm_circles 1m\n          leg_swings 1m\n        main straight_sets:\n          shoulder_press 3x6 rpe 5 rest 60 seconds\n          bent_over_row 3x6 rpe 5 rest 60 seconds\n          dumbbell_fly 2x8 rpe 4 rest 45 seconds\n          cable_row 2x8 rpe 5 rest 60 seconds\n          tricep_extension 2x10 rpe 4 rest 45 seconds\n          lateral_raise 2x10 rpe 4 rest 45 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          back_stretch 90 seconds\n          tricep_stretch 90 seconds\n          spinal_twist 90 seconds\n```",
